sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Guest visitor
    participant Web as Public web
    participant API as FastAPI (auth)
    participant DB as Postgres

    User->>Web: Enter email at checkout
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/guest {email}
    API->>API: normalise(email), email_hash(SHA256(pepper||email))
    API->>DB: INSERT auth_sessions(kind=guest, guest_email, expires_at)
    API->>API: mint guest JWT (kind=guest, sub=guest:<email_hash>, scope=[orders:create,...])
    API-->>Web: 200 {access_token (Guest), expires_in=1800}
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/orders<br/>Authorization: Guest <jwt>
    API->>API: verify JWT (kind=guest), enforce scope
    API-->>Web: 201 order
